# R6 acceptance transcript: reachability over indexed structure.
#
# R5 |- R6. Closure walks once.
#
# The graph is a map from artifact name to the names it references, the
# policy is a set of admitted names, and the closure is a visited set fed
# by a work queue: every artifact examined once, a cycle only a name the
# visited set already holds, and policy applied before traversal. The
# cons-list engine is restated beside it and both walks answer alike.

